OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after woman's balcony
OL,4,Afall death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 18 years for
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after a frightened woman
OL,8,Ffell or jumped to her death from a
OL,9,Fthird-floor balcony.
OL,11,FTia Langdon, 25, died in hospital after
OL,12,Ffalling from a block of flats at
OL,13,FCuckmere Lane, Southampton, on 28
OL,14,FAugust 2025.
OL,16,FJaiden Hassan-Agard, 20, of Stour
OL,17,FClose, Southampton, was convicted in
OL,18,FJuly of nine charges against two women,
OL,19,Fincluding manslaughter, false
OL,20,Fimprisonment, assault and making
OL,21,Fthreats to kill.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
