OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after woman's balcony
OL,4,Afall death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing him at Winchester Crown
OL,7,FCourt, Mrs Justice Tipples said: "You
OL,8,Fterrorised her so much that she saw no
OL,9,Foption but to try to escape you by
OL,10,Fgoing over the balcony."
